### 人事行政一期接口示例；先在环境中配置 adminToken 和 host
@host = http://localhost:48080/admin-api
@adminToken = {{token}}

### 人员工作台统计；需要 hradmin:employee:query，仅统计已建档人员
GET {{host}}/hradmin/employee/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 分页查询；需要 hradmin:employee:query
GET {{host}}/hradmin/employee/page?pageNo=1&pageSize=10&name=
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 查看详情；需要 hradmin:employee:query
GET {{host}}/hradmin/employee/get?id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 创建档案；需要 hradmin:employee:create。userId 可留空，建档不会开通账号。
POST {{host}}/hradmin/employee/create
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeNo": "E0001",
  "userId": 141,
  "name": "示例员工",
  "deptId": null,
  "positionName": "人事专员",
  "projectName": "平台公共服务",
  "hireDate": "2026-09-28",
  "probationEndDate": "2026-12-28",
  "contractEndDate": "2028-09-28",
  "contractStatus": 1,
  "socialStatus": 1,
  "employmentStatus": 1
}

### 更新档案；需要 hradmin:employee:update。已绑定账号不可在此改绑。
PUT {{host}}/hradmin/employee/update
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "employeeNo": "E0001",
  "userId": 141,
  "name": "示例员工",
  "positionName": "人事专员",
  "employmentStatus": 1
}

### 账号启停与分配角色继续调用 System 既有接口，分别需要：
### system:user:update 和 system:permission:assign-user-role
